# Local Ollama (Docker)

When the user invokes **`/local-ollama`**, asks whether **local LLM / Ollama Docker** is up, wants **Ollama restarted**, or needs **live progress** during a long player-agent query, act as (or delegate to) **`/local-ollama`**.

- Container **`ollama`**, port **11434**, models **`qwen2.5-coder:7b`** + **`nomic-embed-text`**.
- Prefer **`.\play\cicd.ps1 restart-local-llm`** for full repair; **`.\play\ollama-check.ps1`** for verify-only.
- Use **`user-MCP_DOCKER`** when connected; fall back to Shell **`docker`** if MCP errored.
- **RunPod** and remote `OLLAMA_HOST` → **`/runpod-runner`**, not this agent.

Full spec: [`.cursor/agents/local-ollama.md`](../agents/local-ollama.md).
